00:04:48.240 --> 00:04:50.600
Who knew? We probably don't
need oncologists anymore.

00:04:50.600 --> 00:04:52.600
We probably don't need
many doctors anymore.

00:04:52.600 --> 00:04:55.820
We just need a bunch
of phoena, phoenixians.

00:04:55.820 --> 00:04:56.653
- [Sam] Phoenixes?

00:04:56.653 --> 00:04:57.750
- Phoenixians.

00:04:57.750 --> 00:04:58.658
- [Sam] Mm-hmm.

00:04:58.658 --> 00:05:01.325
