00:05:33.160 --> 00:05:34.840
But there are techniques you
could use to hold your breath

00:05:34.840 --> 00:05:36.540
for a really long time underwater.

00:05:37.936 --> 00:05:39.340
- [Harry] You're sure about this, Neville?

00:05:39.340 --> 00:05:40.173
- [Neville] Absolutely.

00:05:40.173 --> 00:05:41.060
- [Harry] For an hour?

00:05:41.060 --> 00:05:41.893
- [Neville] Most likely.

00:05:41.893 --> 00:05:44.630
- Is he taking
performance-enhancing drugs?

00:05:44.630 --> 00:05:45.843
So he's cheating?

00:05:45.843 --> 00:05:48.593
