00:06:08.050 --> 00:06:10.140
Barotrauma, all of the above, really.

00:06:10.140 --> 00:06:11.170
And for those of you who don't know,

00:06:11.170 --> 00:06:12.480
like when you breathe water,

00:06:12.480 --> 00:06:14.840
when you breathe underwater
usually with a scuba set,

00:06:14.840 --> 00:06:17.360
not through gills, and you breathe in air

00:06:17.360 --> 00:06:19.730
like let's say 10 meters
down, 33 feet down

00:06:19.730 --> 00:06:21.230
and then you ascend too quickly,

00:06:21.230 --> 00:06:23.560
that air expands, it
could damage your lungs.

00:06:23.560 --> 00:06:28.560
- Bone of the father, unwillingly given.

00:06:29.020 --> 00:06:33.737
Flesh of the servant,
willingly sacrificed.

00:06:37.198 --> 00:06:38.284
